chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a snare roll and a timpani hit; the brass announces the first four notes of a heroic march motif}
{electric guitar power chords swell under it}

[Theme]
{the full heroic brass melody over a driving rock beat and a marching snare}
{the guitars chug in eighth notes}

[Answer]
{the strings take the melody one octave higher, the brass answers with short fanfare stabs}
{the drums switch to a half-time groove}

[Development]
{the motif broken into fragments passed between horns, trumpets and guitar over new chords}
{a rising sequence, tom-heavy drums}

[Breakdown]
{the band drops out: a low string ostinato and timpani pulses}
{a solo French horn plays the motif slowly in minor, tense}

[Ending]
{a final heroic statement in half-time}
{one big unison hit on the downbeat and a natural ring-out; no fade-out}
